<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>DrakeForge for Dragon86</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0">
<!--
  Optional, no-code-change Dragon86 integration.

  Copy this file into Dragon86's ~/system/apps/ (or open it from Files) to launch the
  unified DrakeForge workspace in a Dragon86 window. The root URL is same-origin with
  Dragon86's Pages site, which is what allows postMessage and the fs1 bridge to work.
  `?mode=embed` uses only parent-frame postMessage and intentionally disables
  BroadcastChannel, so it cannot collide with separate-tab engine sessions.
  `cross-origin-isolated` is delegated because BrowserPod needs SharedArrayBuffer;
  Dragon86's own coi-serviceworker isolates the top page.
-->
<iframe
  src="https://dragon-gaming-platforms.github.io/DrakeForge/?mode=embed"
  title="DrakeForge workspace for Dragon86"
  style="border:0;display:block;width:100vw;height:100vh"
  allow="cross-origin-isolated; clipboard-read; clipboard-write; fullscreen"
></iframe>
</body>
</html>
